  "body": "A variety of specs want to link to PostMessageOptions/transfer. Hopefully this will enable them to do so, while also enhancing our own internal cross-referencing.\n\n(I didn't mark this up with data-export and all the rest of the Bikeshed definition contract, since currently everything is being inferred by the scraper. If we change to be explicit, we should do so as discussed in #5694.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/web-messaging.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">/web-messaging.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/395923f...fceb301/web-messaging.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/395923f...fceb301/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">/workers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5860/395923f...fceb301/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 24, 2020, 9:18 PM UTC (fceb301)\">diff</a> )",
